  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Exam City Details 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-10T13:53:16+05:30\">June 10, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">1:53 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.abvmucet26.co.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University, Uttar Pradesh</a>&nbsp;</strong>has released the <strong>Exam City Details</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for admission to the <strong data-start=\"195\" data-end=\"243\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Uttar Pradesh GNM Entrance Test (UPGET) 2026</strong>. The&nbsp;<strong>Exam</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">will be conducted on<strong> 16 June 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>UPGNM</strong>&nbsp;application process started on&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\">29 April 2026</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\">02 June 2026</strong>. Candidates can check their&nbsp;<strong>Exam City Details </strong>using their&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the&nbsp;<strong>portal. The direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Exam City Details 2026</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Admission 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/up-get-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <b>29 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date for Apply Online :<b> 26 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date Online Payment :&nbsp;<b>26 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>19-26 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\">Exam Date : 16 June 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">10 June 2026 Available Now</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<b>09 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Declared : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><b> Will Be Updated Here Soon</b></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>General, EWS, OBC</strong> : <b><strong>₹&nbsp;</strong>3000/-</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>SC, ST, PH</strong> : <b><strong>₹ </strong></b><strong>2000/-&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong>&nbsp;You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Notification 2026 : Age Limits As On 31 December 2026</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age<strong> : 17 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>NA</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Check More Details For<strong> UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET 2026 </strong>Visit<strong> Official Website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Online Form 2026 : Admission Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.5887%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Course Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.0779%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 21.5887%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">GNM Course 3 Year</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.0779%; text-align: center;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Passed <strong>10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> with <strong>40% marks in English</strong> (including Vocational ANM Course). Must be a <strong>Registered ANM</strong> with passing marks. Check the official notification for details.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/iit-jee-advanced-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">IIT JEE Advanced Online Form 2026</a></span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Exam City Details 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Visit the official website of <strong data-start=\"113\" data-end=\"179\">Atal Bihari Vajpayee Medical University (ABVMU), Uttar Pradesh</strong>.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"198\" data-end=\"240\">“UPGET 2026 Exam City Intimation Slip”</strong>&nbsp;link available on the homepage.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Enter your <strong data-start=\"288\" data-end=\"310\">Application Number</strong>,&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"338\">Date of Birth/Password</strong>, and Security Code.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Click on the <strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"394\">Login / Submit</strong>&nbsp;button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Your allotted <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"442\">Exam City Details</strong>&nbsp;will appear on the screen.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Check the exam city, exam date, and other details carefully.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Download the City Intimation Slip PDF.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Take a printout for future reference and travel planning.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Keep checking the official website for the release of the Admit Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Online Form 2026 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Entrance Examination&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Merit List</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Counseling Process</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our Telegram Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><stro