:</strong> <strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"718\">Is the Exam City Intimation Slip the same as the Admit Card?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong>No, the Exam City Intimation Slip only provides information about the allotted exam city. The Admit Card is released separately.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of <strong>UPGET</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of <strong>UPGET</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>is <strong>https://www.abvmucet26.co.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-36305 aligncenter\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-47-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"UP GNM Entrance Test UPGET Exam City Details 2026\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-47-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-47-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-47-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-47.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></p>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:50%; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><h3>Latest Posts</h3><p><a href=